  abilities:
  - evidenceTypes: 04000000
    description: When Dragolt swallows an object that the malevolent spirit has recently
      interacted with, he can determine its <color=#F9AB2D>activity value</color>.
  - evidenceTypes: 04000000
    description: Dragolt can sometimes detect <color=#F9AB2D>activity with a value
      of 5</color> instead of activity with a value of 4 if the malicious spirit
      has the potential to do so.
  - evidenceTypes: 02000000
    description: When Dragolt swallows a <color=#F9AB2D>candle</color>, he spits
      it out again and <color=#F9AB2D>it is lit</color>.
